#ASSERT `Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 subject answer: yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) other personal data` `P1 subject answer: no` EQUALS NOTHING
